    "explanation": "Zul'jin performs best with Heroes who are able to provide him a strong frontline as well as Healers who can help him manage his Health drain. Uther and Tyrael work particularly well with Zul'jin as Divine Shield and Sanctification can be overlapped with Taz'dingo! for a phenomenal results."
