    "explanation": "Zul'jin's role as a Basic Attack focused Ranged Assassin makes him a viable pick for most occasions. Nothing about his kit makes him particularly good or bad or any specific map and his viablity in a match should be centered more around the team's composition and it's needs as opposed to the map selection."
